</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="w-separator size_custom" style="height:10px"></div><div class="g-cols wpb_row us_custom_153527f8 via_flex valign_top type_default stacking_default"><div class="vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column vc_column_container"><div class="vc_column-inner"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h4 style="text-align: left" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading us_custom_8e19c095" >Popular Link</h4><nav class="w-menu for_simple_menu layout_ver style_links us_menu_1" style="--main-gap:0.5rem;--main-ver-indent:0.8em;--main-hor-indent:0.8em;--main-color:var(--color-header-middle-bg);--main-hover-color:var(--color-header-top-text-hover);--main-active-color:var(--color-header-top-text-hover);"><ul id="menu-popular-links" class="menu"><li id="menu-item-26270" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-26270"><a href="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/licensys/">LicenSys</a></li><li id="menu-item-22375" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-22375"><a href="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/fees/">Fees</a></li><li id="menu-item-22374" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-22374"><a href="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/checklist-forms/">Forms</a></li><li id="menu-item-25330" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-post current-menu-item menu-item-25330"><a href="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/international-securities-commodities-alerts-network-i-scan-alerts/" aria-current="page">I-SCAN Alerts</a></li><li id="menu-item-24405" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-24405"><a href="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/complaints-procedure/">Complaints</a></li><li id="menu-item-26791" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-26791"><a href="https://licensys.belizefsc.org.bz/#/publicSearch">Licensed / Registered Service Providers</a></li><li id="menu-item-26792" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-26792"><a href="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/filed-prospectus-offering-document/">Filed Prospectus/Offering Document</a></li><li id="menu-item-26825" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-26825"><a href="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/investor-centre/">Investor Centre</a></li><li id="menu-item-26753" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-26753"><a href="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/career/">Career</a></li></ul><style>@media ( max-width:600px ){.us_menu_1 .menu{display:block!important}.us_menu_1 .menu>li:not(:last-child){margin:0 0 var(--main-gap,0.5rem)!important}}</style></nav></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="vc_col-sm-9 wpb_column vc_column_container has_bg_color"><div class="vc_column-inner us_custom_25036496"><div class="wpb_wrapper"><h1 class="w-post-elm post_title us_custom_40f3a896 has_text_color color_link_inherit">International Securities &amp; Commodities Alerts Network (I-Scan Alerts)</h1><div class="w-post-elm post_content">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>The International Organization of Securities Commissions (IOSCO)</strong> <strong>launched a new investor alerts portal, a dedicated platform to help combat retail investment fraud globally.</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The <a href="https://www.iosco.org/i-scan/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">International Securities &amp; Commodities Alerts Network (<strong>I-SCAN</strong>)</a> is a unique global warning system where any investor, online service provider, bank or institution can check if a suspicious activity has been flagged for a particular company by financial regulators worldwide.</p>



<div style="height:15px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><a href="https://www.iosco.org/i-scan/" target="_blank" rel=" noreferrer noopener"><img decoding="async" width="289" height="101" data-src="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/i-scan-black.webp" alt="" class="wp-image-25137 lazyload" style="--smush-placeholder-width: 289px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 289/101;width:381px;height:auto" src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==" /></a></figure>



<div style="height:44px" aria-hidden="true" class="wp-block-spacer"></div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full is-resized"><a href="https://www.iosco.org/" target="_blank" rel=" noreferrer noopener"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" width="567" height="268" src="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IOSCO.png" alt="" class="wp-image-25312" style="width:537px;height:auto" srcset="https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/IOSCO.png 567w, https://www.belizefsc.org.bz/wp-content/smush-webp/2025/05/IOSCO-300x142.png.webp 300w" sizes="(max-width: 567px) 100vw, 567px" data-smush-webp-fallback="{&quot;srcset&quot;:&quot;https:\/\/www.belizefsc.org.bz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/IOSCO.png 567w, https:\/\/www.belizefsc.org.bz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/IOSCO-300x142.png 300w&quot;}" /></a></figure>
</div>
</div>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-dots"/>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>About IOSCO:</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The International Organization of Securities Commissions (IOSCO) is the leading international policy forum for securities regulators and the global standard setter for financial markets regulation. It develops, implements, and promotes adherence to internationally recognized standards for financial markets regulation and works closely with other international organizations on the global regulatory reform agenda.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">On May 20, 2024, the Commission was accepted as an associate member of the IOSCO. This milestone marked a significant step in fostering international cooperation in Belize’s financial services sector. By joining IOSCO, the Belize FSC reaffirms its commitment to adhering to international standards and best practices, thereby bolstering investor confidence, and promoting market integrity in Belize.</p>
